00001: {
00002:   "schema": "gr8-world-time-consumer-correction/v2",
00003:   "utc": "2026-10-16T05:26:45.329997+00:00",
00004:   "reader": "/root/world_full",
00005:   "correction_id": "WORLD-TIME-ITEM-CORRECTION-01",
00006:   "trigger": "Actual non-proposer /root readback found WFS103-04 nil/false overcompression; own source reread confirms. This is fact-ledger precision, no formal candidate.",
00007:   "original_frozen_packet": {
00008:     "path": "time-consumer-source-supplement.json",
00009:     "bytes": 12945,
00010:     "sha256": "cf83e454e5b3929bdce691264a4cba0cd4a333355ef43652ef09e1f52bd8a2d5"
00011:   },
00012:   "original_fact_id": "WFS-103-04",
00013:   "old_fact": "itemsetter仅合法身份可写，否则保旧；hasItem无参看raw非nil，有参通过Item.try_get及相等；类型从species_data.types clone，避免把consumer过滤改变原记录。",
00014:   "current_replacement_fact": "itemsetter对truthy先查exists，类型合法但未登记者保旧，合法登记者规范化写id；nil实际清空、false实际写false（后继item读取可类型错误）。无参hasItem看raw非nil；带非nil参数先try_get所持raw，再以Item实例==原checkparam比较，不单独规范化查询checkparam。类型从species_data.types clone。精确边界见time-consumer-item-correction.v2.json七完整子断言。",
00015:   "explicit_clarifications": [
00016:     {
00017:       "id": "WFS10304-C01",
00018:       "fact": "item=(value)在value为truthy时才调用Item.exists?；可接受类型且未登记身份使该检查false而直接return，旧@item保留。非法类型可能在exists?的validate先抛ArgumentError，不能无条件称安全保旧返回。",
00019:       "source": "Pokemon563–566; GameData89–106; Validation1–31"
00020:     },
00021:     {
00022:       "id": "WFS10304-C02",
00023:       "fact": "truthy且登记存在时，以Item.get(value).id写@item；String经该访问器转Symbol，Item对象按登记id检查；本句前提为访问/赋值正常且无其它写入。",
00024:       "source": "Pokemon563–566; GameData89–106; Item46"
00025:     },
00026:     {
00027:       "id": "WFS10304-C03",
00028:       "fact": "nil不进入exists?，条件表达式走原value并写@item=nil，普通调用清空；不是保留旧值。",
00029:       "source": "Pokemon563–566"
00030:     },
00031:     {
00032:       "id": "WFS10304-C04",
00033:       "fact": "false亦不进入exists?且原样写@item=false。无参hasItem?检查!@item.nil?因此为true；后继item/getter走Item.try_get(false)的类型校验，FalseClass不在Symbol/Item/String接受域而可抛ArgumentError。不得把false扩大成合法物品身份或普通nil清空。",
00034:       "source": "Pokemon553–579; GameData109–115; Validation1–31"
00035:     },
00036:     {
00037:       "id": "WFS10304-C05",
00038:       "fact": "带非nil参数hasItem?(check_item)先self.item，即Item.try_get读取heldraw；该try_get规范化的是所持raw，不是check_item。随后held_item && held_item==check_item，不另对check_item调用try_get/get；缺所持合法记录时可nil而非严格false。",
00039:       "source": "Pokemon553–579; GameData109–115"
00040:     },
00041:     {
00042:       "id": "WFS10304-C06",
00043:       "fact": "合法held_item的==由GameData::InstanceMethods处理：nil false；Symbol比@id，同类实例比id，String转symbol比id，Integer比@id_number，其它false。此比较域不等于setter/Item.try_get的接受域，不把“checkparam normalization”当单独查询。",
00044:       "source": "GameData220–233; Item46–47"
00045:     },
00046:     {
00047:       "id": "WFS10304-C07",
00048:       "fact": "原WFS103-04同一复合对象中“类型从species_data.types clone”保留；更正只替换itemsetter/hasItem缩写，不新增正式finding、Required、policy或行为执行。",
00049:       "source": "Pokemon179–193;550–579"
00050:     }
00051:   ],
